"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"A Short Hike is an Archipelago core game, meaning it does not require a custom world file (.apworld).\nBecause of this, aside from installing the mods, all you need to do is create your YAML file using the 'Options Creator' in the AP Launcher and send it to the person hosting the AP multiworld.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, press 'new game' and an Archipelago connection window should appear.\n\nEnter archipelago.gg:XXXXX in the 'Server' field, where XXXXX is the room’s port. You can find this number on the website after creating a new room.\n\nIn 'Name', enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nThe 'Password' field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nFinally, click 'Start game' and the game should start!\n\nYou can also change some AP related settings in the 'QOL Settings' tab!",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Revert Infos",
"kill",
"You have 2 revert options, both can't be enabled at the same time.\n\nIf you use the 'Clear AP Mods' option it will only delete the mods that are required for A Short Hike Archipelago.\n\nIf you use the 'Full Clear' option it will delete everything related to BepInEx, the Mod Loader and mods. If other mods are detected an additionnal confirmation will appear.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] PopTracker Infos",
"kill",
"Some games have a PopTracker integration for Archipelago which allows you to track all possible Locations, Items, Upgrades, Zones, Hints and more depending on the game.\n\nFor the setup there are 3 different cases:\n\n\t• If the selected directory does not contain a PopTracker folder (or any similarly named folder), a new 'poptracker' folder will be created and the pack will be downloaded to poptracker\\packs.\n\n\t• If the selected directory already contains a folder with 'PopTracker' in its name, the installer will look for a poptracker.exe file. If one is found, the pack will be downloaded to its packs folder. If no poptracker.exe is found, the folder will be renamed to 'poptracker' and any missing files or folders will be created.\n\n\t• If the selected directory is already a PopTracker folder (for example: C:\\Users\\magni\\Documents\\poptracker), its contents will be validated. If everything is present, the pack will simply be downloaded to poptracker\\packs. Otherwise, the folder will be repaired before the pack is installed.",
"clear"

